    "narrative": "For today\u2019s slate, **Jonathan Aranda** remains the central figure of the lineup, though he faces a difficult test against the elite 2.35 xERA of the opposing starter. While his base projection took a hit due to the high quality of the opposition, his spot in the #2 hole and a strong platoon advantage keep him firmly in the \"Marginal\" start category. Given our organizational mandate to prioritize speed, we are keeping a close eye on **Masyn Winn** and **Justin Crawford** in the periphery; their sprint speed profiles are currently our primary levers to gain ground in the SB category, even as we navigate a day where high-end matchups are otherwise scarce.\n\nThe roster optimization process for this session was heavily impacted by the team off-day, which sidelined core producers like **Jos\u00e9 Ram\u00edrez**, **Bryce Harper**, **Cal Raleigh**, and **Lawrence Butler**. With those heavy hitters unavailable, the burden shifts to the supporting cast\u2014specifically **Daulton Varsho** and **JJ Bleday**\u2014to maintain our efficiency metrics. **Luis Arraez** remains our most reliable asset for protecting the AVG category, though his lack of multi-category upside means he rarely cracks the 90+ elite tier. We have benched **Gleyber Torres** and **Matt Chapman** in favor of high-leverage defensive and speed specialists to ensure we don't bleed points against lower-ceiling matchups.\n\nRisk management remains our primary concern, as we have several players\u2014including **Zack Gelof**, **Jung Hoo Lee**, and **Brendan Donovan**\u2014awaiting finalized batting orders. Should **Dylan Beavers** or **Gavin Sheets** be slotted lower than expected, we are prepared to pivot to **Alex Freeland** or **Kyle Karros** to optimize for late-game substitution efficiency. **Yainer Diaz** and **Will Smith** continue to provide stability behind the dish, but we are wary of any late-breaking weather reports that could jeopardize the volume of at-bats for **Jeremiah Jackson** and **Braden Montgomery**. We will monitor the status of **Tyler Freeman** closely, as his versatility is the key to maintaining our daily caps while hunting for steals.",
